    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your board with a host of new pieces. Start with an aggressive forward assault, Or perhaps a defensive fortress designed to weather the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outwit, outmanoeuvre, or out-explode your way to victory?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/86c254d36fbc41a3061e3b994b26c205.poster.avif?t=1753893899\" width=818 height=788 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/86c254d36fbc41a3061e3b994b26c205.webm?t=1753893899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/86c254d36fbc41a3061e3b994b26c205.mp4?t=1753893899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/3ca0ffbf3b5ca544853d4f28a0a176c6.avif?t=1753893899\" width=900 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fusefort: Explodes on capturing/capture, destroying all pieces on that square and to the sides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spearman: pawn who can sidestep and lunge forward to attack 2 spaces ahead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cracked Pawn: a cheaper &amp; weaker pawn, allowing you to purchase more powerful pieces elsewhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warden: A castle that somehow learned to jump, though now he can only reach 2 spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C4D4: Self-destructs destroying a part of the board for both players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/5f1a4f4c246770f34ee633d60385c4b4.avif?t=1753893899\" width=900 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Board Forging:</strong> Create custom boards with new layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Pieces:</strong>\u00a011+ new chess pieces and counting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modes:</strong> Test strategies against AI, or play online.</p></li></ul>",
